         * CommandLineParser parser = new DefaultParser();
         * CommandLine line = parser.parse(options, args);
         * String propertyName = line.getOptionValues("D")[0]; // will be "key"
         * String propertyValue = line.getOptionValues("D")[1]; // will be "value"
         * </pre>
